meta {
  name: List Colleges
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/colleges
  body: none
  auth: none
}

query {
  ~universityId:
  ~streamId:
  ~disciplineId:
  ~studyLevelId:
  ~programTypeId:
  ~state: Karnataka
  ~district: Bangalore
}

docs {
  Returns a lightweight list of active colleges with optional taxonomy and location filters.

  Query parameters (all optional):
  - universityId: Filter by university UUID
  - streamId: Filter by stream UUID (ignored if disciplineId is set)
  - disciplineId: Filter by discipline UUID
  - studyLevelId: Filter by study level UUID
  - programTypeId: Filter by program type UUID
  - state: Filter by state name (case-insensitive, e.g. "Karnataka")
  - district: Filter by district/city name (case-insensitive, e.g. "Bangalore")

  State and district values must match the country-state-city dataset used
  in the college-admin profile form — free-text values are not accepted there.

  Response includes per college:
  - Core fields: id, name, slug, code, domain, logoUrl, coverImageUrl,
    state, city, district, address, pinCode, status, createdAt, updatedAt
  - university: { id, name, logoUrl }
  - campuses: main campus only [{ city, state }]

  Note: profileSections and settings are NOT included in the list response.
  Use Get College By Id or Get College Summary for full details.
}
